{"product_id":"pod-salt-freebase-caramel-tobacco","title":"Pod Salt Freebase - Caramel Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the indulgent taste of Pod Salt Freebase Caramel Tobacco. This premium 60ml e-liquid combines the rich, earthy notes of classic tobacco with a silky caramel finish. Available in 3mg and 6mg nicotine strengths, it provides a smooth inhale and satisfying exhale, making it ideal for both transitioning smokers and dessert-tobacco flavor enthusiasts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavour Profile: Classic Tobacco with Sweet Caramel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60ml Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg Available\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFreebase Formula: Strong flavor \u0026amp; smooth inhale\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTaste Experience: Tobacco richness with creamy caramel sweetness\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium Quality: Consistent and satisfying hit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41991064584247,"sku":"Pod S - Caramel Tobacco - 3 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41991064617015,"sku":"Pod S - Caramel Tobacco - 6 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-freebase-eliquid-caramel-tobacco.webp?v=1763437134","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/pod-salt-freebase-caramel-tobacco","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




